!reports/aho/host_words_by_search_word_filtred.json
!reports/aho/host_words_by_location_filtred.json

# LLM reports: keep manual labels and useful OpenRouter outputs, ignore huge reproducible case build.
reports/llm/reports/
reports/llm/llm_review_cases.json
!reports/llm/README.md
!reports/llm/build_llm_review_cases.py
!reports/llm/llm_audit_dashboard.py
